{"id":"en_bought-by-the-cold-billionaire-season-1","title":"Bought by the Cold Billionaire Season 1","titleEn":"Bought by the Cold Billionaire Season 1","description":"Elena Rowan finds herself stuck in a place called Velvet Trap, where she strikes a bargain with Lucian Noir: her body in exchange for her freedom. Lucian keeps a tight hold over her, yet her heart still belongs to Julian Vane, the love she thought she had lost. When Julian reappears, Elena faces humiliation, betrayal, and the burden of her mother's illness. Lucian shields her even as his fixation grows more intense. Then Elena learns a startling truth—there are two Julians, and one of them is a fraud. She attempts to investigate, but Lucian brushes her concerns aside. Caught between the two men, Elena fights to break away and carve out a life of her own. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/bought-by-the-cold-billionaire-season-1/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/bought-by-the-cold-billionaire-season-1/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Billionaire","Marriage of Convenience","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devom/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_bought-by-the-cold-billionaire-season-1_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devom/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bought-by-the-cold-billionaire-season-1_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devom/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bought-by-the-cold-billionaire-season-1_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Ru